# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo ships ONLY the kicad-schematic-gen skill + its docs.
# Board-specific project outputs, scratch, and caches are ignored.
# Whitelist approach: ignore every top-level entry, then re-include
# exactly what we want to publish.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Ignore everything at the repo root...
/*

# ...except the skill, the project docs, and git meta files.
!.claude/
!CLAUDE.md
!improvements.md
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes

# Local Claude Code settings are machine-specific — never publish them.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Python / pytest caches (including inside the skill's tests/).
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
